      "writtenOn": "2022-07-25T13:58:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "OK, I think the logic is good. I was going to suggest an assert here, to validate our thinking, but I wonder if it would be easier to just do the check here (after the preScale happened to the local matrix)? In other words, we could check here that localMatrix is just a translation matrix (and an integer translation, specifically). I suppose that\u0027s going to have some precision issues with the scale removal (If the original matrix has a non-power of two scale, then preScale by 1/S isn\u0027t necessarily going to produce 1, so we won\u0027t think it\u0027s a pure translation matrix). On the other hand, it would be conservatively correct, and easier to reason about.\n\nI\u0027m not committed to that solution, though - what do you think?",
      "revId": "dc65c22115c8ff0cd8d156b83440ba0b5d52a8c8",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "43de5e76_692838e1",
        "filename": "src/shaders/SkPictureShader.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 10
      },
      "lineNbr": 247,
      "author": {
        "id": 10586
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-07-27T01:13:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we can assert anything about `localMatrix\u0027` here.\n\nRecall that the size of the tile (and therefore the inverse scale we apply here) comes from the product of `viewMatrix * localMatrix`.\n\nAfter the preScale, `localMatrix\u0027` may still have a scale factor in it (if `viewMatrix` has any scale factors).  Similarly, whether or not any translation in `localMatrix\u0027` is integer-only doesn\u0027t tell us about its correctness (again, depending on any scale factors in `viewMatrix`).\n\nIf you want to assert, we\u0027d have to re-multiply `viewMatrix * localMatrix\u0027` and check that result.  (I\u0027m happy to do that, if you like.)\n\n(And yeah, floating-point precision is always a bugbear.)",
      "parentUuid": "ac29dad3_e6c87b9f",
      "revId": "dc65c22115c8ff0cd8d156b83440ba0b5d52a8c8",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
