      "message": "Ah, that makes sense. OK, I\u0027m going to kick off trybots, just to make sure we don\u0027t see any strangeness in golden images. From a quick scan, I think we have tests that exercise picture-shaders containing text, but it may be restricted to a single perspective test. So we might need a new GM that actually hits this code path.",
