      "writtenOn": "2022-07-28T20:12:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right, that all makes sense. So, I take it that the new contrast and gamma settings are being added to SkSurfaceProps? Do you have a timeline for when that might be up for review in Skia?",
      "parentUuid": "07c9eae7_19ce57e1",
      "revId": "dc65c22115c8ff0cd8d156b83440ba0b5d52a8c8",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
